I understood why every previous approach had produced \[specific result\].

The tool was wrong for my biology -- not for PCOS in general, for mine specifically.'\]

THE HORMONE-FIRST APPROACH

The Hormone-First Approach is the clinical methodology we use inside the

Personalized PCOS Protocol to identify your specific hormonal drivers first,

then build every nutrition, movement, and lifestyle enhancement around that profile.

The sequence is:

1\. Hormonal Driver Assessment -- identifying your primary phenotype and drivers

2\. Prioritizing interventions for your 1-2 main drivers

3\. Stabilizing insulin and cortisol

4\. Fat loss, cycle regularity, and metabolic improvement as biological outcomes

The order matters. Addressing weight without addressing the hormonal driver

that is causing the weight gain is like draining water from a bathtub

without turning off the tap.

The Hormone-First Approach turns off the tap.

