In \[timeframe\], she \[specific result: lost X lbs / period returned / HbA1c dropped to X\].

She did not count a single calorie or complete a single 16-hour fast.'\]

WHAT THIS MEANS FOR YOU

If you are navigating PCOS with or without a pre-diabetes diagnosis,

and you have already invested in tools that have not produced lasting results:

the protocol you need exists. It is built around your biology, not a generic template.

